  "details": "So my friend reports a bug that when he opens the game on VR the game locks onto the head orientation. It doesn't freeze or anything cause when he talks the microphone still pops up. He also doesn't have any issues in any other VR game. He uses steam link through meta quest. He had this issue in another VR game but he fixed it by putting openxr in the steam launch settings but it doesn't work with vrchat. We already tried reinstalling the game and clearing the cache and using openvr and tuning off 3rd party apps that might cause this issue but nothing is working. There are no other reports online on this wich is really weird.",
